[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0010","text":"我说智代子──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0020","text":"呀！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0030","text":"！？\n哇、抱歉！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0040","text":"……啊，制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0050","text":"对不起……\n我太容易受惊了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0060","text":"不不，是我考虑不周"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0070","text":"……那个，没事吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0080","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0090","text":"没事的，不过接下来一段时间……\n就算我反应比较大，也希望您能包容一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0100","text":"啊，那当然──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0110","text":"！！？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0120","text":"……没事的，智代子\n刚才只是风"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0130","text":"对，对吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0140","text":"……总之，先换个地方吧\n去亮一点的地方……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0150","text":"──或者，对了！方便的话\n能来帮我准备篝火晚会吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_03_0160","text":"！　好、好的……！\n谢谢您……！"}]
